# Command Shortcuts

If the user message is exactly one of these commands, treat it as a shortcut:

- `start` -> use prompt from `plans/specs/prompts/start.prompt.md`
- `resume` -> use prompt from `plans/specs/prompts/resume.prompt.md`
- `restart` -> use prompt from `plans/specs/prompts/restart.prompt.md`

For `restart`, require explicit confirmation before applying state reset behavior.

Always keep `plans/specs/cursor_resume_state.yaml` in sync with progress milestones and verification gate status.
